                "text": "It was discovered that dpkg-deb (a component of dpkg, the Debian packa ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "It was discovered that dpkg-deb (a component of dpkg, the Debian package management system) does not properly validate the end of the data stream when uncompressing a zstd-compressed .deb archive, which may result in denial of service (infinite loop spinning the CPU)."
              },
