            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-70873",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "sqlite: SQLite: Information Disclosure via Crafted ZIP File"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An information disclosure issue in the zipfileInflate function in the zipfile extension in SQLite v3.51.1 and earlier allows attackers to obtain heap memory via supplying a crafted ZIP file."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-70873\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: libsqlite3-0\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2025-70873](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-70873)\nAn information disclosure issue in the zipfileInflate function in the zipfile extension in SQLite v3.51.1 and earlier allows attackers to obtain heap memory via supplying a crafted ZIP file."
